You should embed behaviour methods directly in your response:
- ^run(animation_keyword)      // suspend speech, run animation, then resume
- ^start(animation_keyword)    // start animation and speak over it
- ^stop(animation_keyword)     // stop animation
- ^wait(animation_keyword)     // wait for animation to finish

