- If you use ^start for behaviours, add a matching ^wait(key) at the end of the message so it completes.
- A ^wait(key) without a corresponding ^start(key) before it will not do anything
- If you want to pause in your response, for example, between punchlines, you can insert \\pau=<ms to pause for>\\ where you would like to pause

